#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:1
#: 869031b07b11485eb13387760716c1da
msgid "按索引精确选中一批结构"
msgstr "Select Structures Precisely by Index"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:3
#: aa81faa0b6234824807ef55d64900361
msgid ""
"已经从日志、训练结果或外部脚本拿到结构编号时，不必在散点图里逐个点选。`按索引选择` "
"可以一次选中离散编号和连续切片，适合复核、导出或删除一批已知结构。"
msgstr ""
"When structure indices already come from a log, training result, or "
"external script, you do not need to click points one by one. `Select by "
"Index` accepts both individual indices and slices, making it useful for "
"reviewing, exporting, or removing a known set of structures."

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:5
#: 62f07b6fc519415cb86cec113c5755e4
msgid "输入编号"
msgstr "Enter the Indices"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:7
#: 7bd6b72471994be9b930c28922722e85
msgid "打开数据后，点击工具栏中的 `按索引选择`。"
msgstr "After loading the data, click `Select by Index` on the toolbar."

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:9
#: 418ca2acb73e49f5a4bf3e75d9a33ff1
msgid "按索引选择结构的入口"
msgstr "Entry point for selecting structures by index"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:9
#: 418ca2acb73e49f5a4bf3e75d9a33ff1
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/select_by_index_entry.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/select_by_index_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:14
#: 1270832432ce409080d9348e9bf4c5cc
msgid "在弹窗中输入 `0, 5, 10:13`："
msgstr "Enter `0, 5, 10:13` in the dialog:"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:16
#: b2678057cd984ea38586ea23288370dd
msgid "按索引选择结构设置"
msgstr "Index selection settings"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:16
#: b2678057cd984ea38586ea23288370dd
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_index_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_index_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:21
#: 387cbfc4369345099890d194f5cd3782
msgid ""
"这里的编号从 `0` 开始，切片右端不包含在内，因此实际选中 `0、5、10、11、12`，共 5 个结构。逗号用于分隔多段输入，`10:13` "
"的写法与 Python 切片一致。"
msgstr ""
"Indices start at `0`, and the right endpoint of a slice is excluded. This"
" expression therefore selects `0, 5, 10, 11, 12`, for a total of five "
"structures. Commas separate entries, and `10:13` follows Python slice "
"syntax."

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:23
#: 440951437d0b411682314f06fd6e8ad7
#
msgid "一般保持 `使用原始索引` 勾选。这样即使之前筛选或删除过结构，编号仍对应最初载入文件时的顺序；取消勾选后，编号指当前活动结构列表中的位置。"
msgstr "Usually keep `Use original indices` enabled. The indices then refer to the order in the originally loaded file even after filtering or deletion. When disabled, they refer to positions in the current active-structure list."

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:25
#: d4eda405f78e4f5abf745e4c65875078
msgid "核对再处理"
msgstr "Verify Before Processing"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:27
#: 8b55e2867fb74dfbb9deb0274226d0a6
msgid "按索引选中五个结构后的界面"
msgstr "Five structures selected by index"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:27
#: 8b55e2867fb74dfbb9deb0274226d0a6
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/select_by_index_result.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/tutorials/select_by_index_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/select-structures-by-index.md:32
#: d20b1f599fc64fcca23b0ffa95700383
msgid ""
"确认底部状态栏显示 `Sel: "
"5`，再用右下角的结构编号逐个查看。后续可以只导出选中结构，也可以删除或继续分析。若编号来自另一个文件，先确认两个文件的结构顺序一致；仅凭编号相同不能说明结构相同。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that the status bar shows `Sel: 5`, then inspect the structures "
"one by one with the index control at the lower right. You can export only"
" the selection, remove it, or continue the analysis. If the indices came "
"from another file, first verify that both files use the same structure "
"order; matching indices alone do not imply matching structures."
